cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this recipe or build on these measurements, please cite it as below."
title: "Qwen-Image-2.1 LoRA on a 12 GB GPU and 32 GB of RAM"
abstract: >-
  A measured, reproducible recipe for training a style LoRA for a 20B-class
  diffusion transformer on a consumer laptop: 11.94 GB VRAM and 31.7 GB RAM,
  NF4 quantisation, CPU offload disabled. Includes peak memory measurements,
  the resolution-triggered stall investigation, and two independent loss curves.
